  "limits": [
    "This clean environment uses new disposable databases/configuration and separate Node processes with the installed pinned runtime. It does not claim a second human review, fresh-machine installation, external OAuth provisioning or a candidate API image.",
    "The local fixture uses real RequestAuthenticator/handlers with a synthetic own-principal identity provider and restricted workload pools; final provider/image qualification remains separate.",
    "Receiver rewriting is confined to a fixed synthetic HTTPS destination and an owned loopback process in Go test code. Production SSRF/transport policy is unchanged.",
    "Real delivery selects transfer.posted. Balance-event ordering is a separately labelled signed synthetic fixture; no new subscription availability is claimed.",
    "Node SQLite is experimental in pinned Node 24.12.0 and is limited to this local example. It is not the ledger authority or an approved shared production receiver store.",
    "The latest integration source snapshot remains immutable. Subsequent OpenAPI wording and generated EOF normalization are documentation/format corrections, with final drift, type, Go and frontend checks; they do not relabel that snapshot.",
    "R13-R17 remain selected work."
  ]
